      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Initial systematic examinations of the heart by ECG-triggered NMR are reported. Twenty-three abnormal findings were observed amongst 46 patients examined. Special indications are the search for cardiac aneurysms, intracardiac thrombi and changes from pressure and volume stress."},
